### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@tenantId = 1
@componentGuid = 00000000000000000000000000000000

### List components (tenant_id required). Optional filters: search, category|comp_category_code, status, calculation|calculation_method_code; page, page_size, sort.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components?tenant_id={{tenantId}}&page=1&page_size=20

### List — search matches component_code, component_name, or comp_category_code (partial, case-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components?tenant_id={{tenantId}}&search=housing

### List — filters: category (alias comp_category_code), status, calculation (alias calculation_method_code)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components?tenant_id={{tenantId}}&category=ALLOWANCE&status=ACTIVE&calculation=FIXED

### Get by numeric id (tenant_id query required). Response includes `description`.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components/123?tenant_id={{tenantId}}

### Get by component_guid (32-char hex). Response includes `description`.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components/{{componentGuid}}

### Create component (description optional; trimmed; max length COMP_COMPONENT_DESCRIPTION_MAX, default 4000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "component_code": "HRA",
  "component_name": "Housing Allowance",
  "description": "Allowance provided for employee housing expenses",
  "component_type_code": "EARNING",
  "calculation_method_code": "FIXED",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "active_flag": "Y",
  "comp_category_code": "ALLOWANCE",
  "effective_start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "flags": {
    "recurring_flag": "Y",
    "optional_flag": "N",
    "pensionable_flag": "N",
    "statutory_flag": "N",
    "include_in_ctc_flag": "Y",
    "prorated_flag": "Y",
    "taxable_flag": "Y"
  },
  "eligibility": {
    "all_employees_flag": "Y",
    "location_codes": []
  },
  "created_by": "ADMIN"
}

### Create component with pay_basis and amortizable_flag (advanced settings table only; not header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "component_code": "BONUS_M",
  "component_name": "Monthly Bonus",
  "component_type_code": "EARNING",
  "calculation_method_code": "FIXED",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "active_flag": "Y",
  "comp_category_code": "ALLOWANCE",
  "pay_basis": "MONTHLY",
  "flags": {
    "recurring_flag": "Y",
    "optional_flag": "N",
    "pensionable_flag": "N",
    "statutory_flag": "N",
    "include_in_ctc_flag": "Y",
    "prorated_flag": "Y",
    "taxable_flag": "Y",
    "amortizable_flag": "Y"
  },
  "eligibility": {
    "all_employees_flag": "Y",
    "location_codes": []
  },
  "created_by": "ADMIN"
}

### Create component without description (backward compatible; stored as null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "component_code": "BASIC2",
  "component_name": "Basic Salary",
  "component_type_code": "EARNING",
  "calculation_method_code": "FIXED",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "active_flag": "Y",
  "comp_category_code": "SALARY",
  "flags": {
    "recurring_flag": "Y",
    "optional_flag": "N",
    "pensionable_flag": "N",
    "statutory_flag": "N",
    "include_in_ctc_flag": "Y",
    "prorated_flag": "Y",
    "taxable_flag": "Y"
  },
  "eligibility": {
    "all_employees_flag": "Y",
    "location_codes": []
  },
  "created_by": "ADMIN"
}

### Update component (send full payload). Omit `description` to keep the existing value; send `"description": null` to clear.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components/{{componentGuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "component_code": "HRA",
  "component_name": "Housing Allowance",
  "description": "Updated housing allowance text",
  "component_type_code": "EARNING",
  "calculation_method_code": "FIXED",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "active_flag": "Y",
  "comp_category_code": "ALLOWANCE",
  "effective_start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "pay_basis": "MONTHLY",
  "flags": {
    "recurring_flag": "Y",
    "optional_flag": "N",
    "pensionable_flag": "N",
    "statutory_flag": "N",
    "include_in_ctc_flag": "Y",
    "prorated_flag": "Y",
    "taxable_flag": "Y",
    "amortizable_flag": "N"
  },
  "eligibility": {
    "all_employees_flag": "Y",
    "location_codes": []
  },
  "updated_by": "ADMIN"
}

### Delete component
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/components/{{componentGuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "user": "ADMIN"
}
